        "description": "Alumni Hall is home to the Advancement Divison, which includes the offices of Development, Annual Giving, Alumni and Parent Relations, Stewardship, and Advancement Services. Also house in the building are Marketing and Communication, College Events, and Music Orgnaizations, which provides support for the ensemble tours and Christmas Festival. As part of the Clemens V. Granskou Compex, named in the honor of the fifth president of St. Olaf College, Alumni Hall connects to the Hall of Music, which serves as an annex to Christiansen Hall of Music.",
