        "description": "Worship is the primary purposes of Boe Chapel, which houses the Office of College Ministrat. During daily chapel services the community hears from faculty members, students and campus guests. And each Sunday morning while school is in session, the Student Congregation gathers for worship. Student and faculty musicians offer the fits and talents, not just as soloists but as members of bands, choirs, orchestras, and small ensembles.",
