        "description": "Rand Hall, nestled into the north face of Manitou Heights, houses 243 upper-class men and women. A variety of living options are available in Rand including single, double, and quad occupancy rooms. Suites share their own bathrooms. The hillside location offers a beautiful view of the woods and fields surrounding the college.",
