        "description": "Skoglund Center hosts varsity basketball and volleyball games in its 2008-seat arena, and its natatorium is home to the swimming and diving teams. Men's Basketball Women's Basketball Volleyball Skoglund also has a field house, racquetball courts, wrestling room, locker rooms, an athletic training room, and is home to the Kinesiology Department. Outdoor tennis courts are located behind the building, near the softball, baseball and soccer fields. In addition to housing athletics, Skoglund Center is used for large ensemble performances - including the annual St. Olaf Christmas Festival.",
