        "description": "Hector Skifter Hall houses the administrative offices for Broadcast Media and extended practice/studio space for the Music Department. Home to the college's organ studies, Skifter Hall has been specifically redesigned and renovated to house several practice organs and rehearsal spaces acoustically engineered for the instrument. The Tormodsgaard-Bakken Recital Hall (Studio A) contains a Dobson three-manual tracker organ and is used for studio sessions, musical instruction, and rehearsals.",
