        "description": "Located on the second floor of Buntrock Commons on the beautiful St. Olaf campus. This room is open to reserve 7 days a week, and weekly dining offerings are served Monday - Friday, 11:00 a.m. - 1:30 p.m. The Kings' Dining Room is the perfect spot to have a delicious, made from scratch meal, whether it is for a business meeting or a gathering of friends and family!",
