        "description": "Boasting an aerobics training facility, exercise machines, a weight-training facility, an elevated walking and jogging ring, a six-land 200 meter track, up to four volleyball or basketball courts, five indoor tennis courts, and a 48-foot high rock-climbing wall - the 95,000 square foot Tostrud Center is a state-of-the-art recreation and fitness center. Related Links Climbing Wall Fitness Classes Intramurals Open Recreation Recreation St. Olaf Outdoor Recreation Program (STORP)",
